// Ch1 C1-12 "Cutscene: the Rising", and the start of C1-13. O11: the far horizon under a clear blue
// sky; the sea draws back off the outer reef; the Undertow stands up out of the sea, a wall of dark
// water and cloud lit from within by cyan wounds, into a sky that stays blue (preset ch01_arrival).
// O12: the town's drill, as old as the town, practised and fast, and frightening because it's
// practised; Kell on her stall's roof lights the big beacon lamp so divers in the water can find the
// keel-hull (her job in the drill). O13: the Seventh Terrace casting off for open water under full
// sail (sea room beats a mooring); the last time anyone sees her crewed. All cuts.
// Rhen's lines are few and short (a sudden short line when it matters). No VO.
// After the letterbox: Kell, on her roof, sees him and points away from herself. The run's choice
// (C1-13): "Kell first." sets ch01_ran_for_kell and reports <<event ch01_kell_first>>, so the
// chapter flow starts the run at her bridge. Both paths end at the net-pen hull. As the letterbox lifts, the
// cue's second stem (the pulse) comes in over 2 s for the run (M3-AUD-829).
title: ch01_the_rising
location: ch01/oruvel
---
@letterbox on
@camera O11
@wait 2.0
@sfx undertow_wall_roar
@music undertow_rising fade=1.0
@wait 3.0
Rhen [afraid]: The reef's showing. #line:ch01_rising_001
@wait 2.0
@camera O12
Sabe [determined]: Cut the low hulls loose! Everyone to the keel-hull! Children first! #line:ch01_rising_002
Netmender [determined]: Lines in! Lines in! #line:ch01_rising_003
@anim kell light_beacon
Kell [determined]: Divers in the water, watch my lamp! Swim for the light! #line:ch01_rising_004
@camera O13
Skipper_Sadi [determined]: Cast off! Sea room, all of you, find sea room! #line:ch01_rising_005
@wait 2.0
@camera release
@letterbox off
@music undertow_rising stem=1 fade=2.0
Rhen [afraid]: Kell! #line:ch01_rising_006
Kell [angry]: Not me, you fool! The net-pen! The little ones! #line:ch01_rising_007
-> Go to the net-pen. #line:ch01_rising_008
-> Kell first. #line:ch01_rising_009
    <<set $ch01_ran_for_kell = true>>
    <<event ch01_kell_first>>
===
